'''UltraBaaBaa''' (ウルトラメェメェ, ''Urutorame~eme~e'', '''UltraMeeMee''') is a [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Alien]] variant of [[Baa Baa]] that appears in [[Cats of the Cosmos]] and [[Legend Stages]]. She was added in [[Version 6.9 Update|Version 6.9]].

