==Trivia==
*Her design could be a reference to [[wikia:ultra:Pigmon|Pigmon]], a similarly spiky kaiju from the ''Ultraman'' series. Some portrayals of Pigmon give his spikes a texture rather like the ones on UltraBaaBaa's head, and both have grooves in their legs and tail. Her tail is also noticeably longer than [[Baa Baa]]'s (its full length can be seen right when she attacks), bringing it closer to Pigmon's. This is further supported by how [[Scissoroo|many]] [[Shibalien Elite|of]] [[Star Peng|the]] [[Le'Solar|other]] [[Youcan|Aliens]] are also inspired by ''Ultraman'' characters.
*UltraBaaBaa is most commonly seen in Chapters 2 and 3 of [[Cats of the Cosmos]], but her actual debut was in [[Singularityville]], which was released when there was only one CotC chapter. This is why she appears so much earlier into [[Legend Stages]] than [[Kid Tappa]] and [[Ribbo]].
*She has the lowest health of all [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]] and is tied with [[Youcan]] for the highest [[Barrier]] limit in the game.
**Both UltraBaaBaa and Youcan are also spammed in stages with "Genome" in their name: UltraBaaBaa in [[Haunted Genome]], Youcan in [[Banana Genomes]].

